---
/* Ambient light for a light band. Three soft radials at 26–34% opacity under a
   130–150px blur, bleeding off the viewport edge.

   Lifted from auramusic.ai, where it is the single best finish-per-byte decision on
   the page: no image request, no licence, and it is what stops a large bone surface
   from reading as blank paper. The blur is not a nicety — at 150px the radial stops
   having a shape and becomes light. Without it these are three coloured circles.

   The wrapper is viewport-wide and clips, so the blobs can sit at negative offsets and
   still be cut cleanly at the screen edge. It must NOT be placed on the element that
   carries the `.surf-*` full-bleed box-shadow: `overflow: hidden` there would clip the
   band itself and the section would shrink back to container width. */
---
<span class="ambient" aria-hidden="true">
  <i class="a1"></i><i class="a2"></i><i class="a3"></i>
</span>
